---
---
<section class="ai-section">
  <div class="ai-inner">
    <h2 class="ai-title">
      Conecta tu <span class="ai-chatgpt">ChatGPT</span> o tu <span class="ai-claude">Claude</span> a tu Nómina.
    </h2>
    <p class="ai-desc">
      Pregúntale lo que quieras sobre tu nómina. En lenguaje natural. Con tus números reales.
    </p>
    <div class="ai-media">
      <img
        src="https://aleluya.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/image-10.png"
        alt="Consulta tu nómina con IA en lenguaje natural"
        loading="lazy"
        class="ai-img"
      />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .ai-section {
    background: #FFB700;
    padding: 96px 80px;
  }
  .ai-inner { max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; }

  .ai-title {
    font-size: clamp(32px, 4.5vw, 64px);
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #1E1E1E;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    max-width: 900px;
  }
  .ai-chatgpt { color: #10A37F; }
  .ai-claude  { color: #5E25FF; }

  .ai-desc {
    font-size: 20px;
    color: #1E1E1E;
    line-height: 1.55;
    margin-bottom: 48px;
    max-width: 700px;
    opacity: 0.8;
  }

  .ai-media {
    background: #fff;
    border-radius: 20px;
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: 0 16px 48px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
  }
  .ai-img { width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .ai-section { padding: 64px 24px; }
    .ai-title { font-size: 32px; }
  }
</style>
